    { title: 'Climbing up: parent = \u230Ai/2\u230B', narration: 'At i = 5 the parent index is \u230A5/2\u230B = 2, and the node holding 7 does hang below the node holding 14. Indices 4 and 5 both map back to parent 2 — integer division folds two children into one parent.', state: { i: 5, mode: 'Structural links' } },
